our_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +1\">Studded Leather Armour +1</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +2\">Studded Leather Armour +2</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dominica_Arsetz\" title=\"Dominica Arsetz\">Dominica Arsetz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Inquisitor of the Absolute\">Inquisitor of the Absolute</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ironhand_Grenadier\" title=\"Ironhand Grenadier\">Ironhand Grenadier</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Durinbold%27s_Attendant\" title=\"Lady Durinbold's Attendant\">Lady Durinbold's Attendant</a>,  <a hre